      "writtenOn": "2022-09-30T15:18:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sounds like [LTO](https://llvm.org/docs/LinkTimeOptimization.html) is not working. I think you need to add `-flto` to the compilation and link flags for `boringssl`.\n \nSomething like this in the `toolchain.cmake` file:\n\n```\nset(CMAKE_C_FLAGS \"${CMAKE_C_FLAGS} -flto\")\nset(CMAKE_CXX_FLAGS \"${CMAKE_CXX_FLAGS} -flto\")\nset(CMAKE_EXE_LINKER_FLAGS \"${CMAKE_EXE_LINKER_FLAGS} -flto\")\n```\n\nor [this might do it automatically](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/prop_tgt/INTERPROCEDURAL_OPTIMIZATION.html#prop_tgt:INTERPROCEDURAL_OPTIMIZATION):\n\n```\nset(CMAKE_INTERPROCEDURAL_OPTIMIZATION TRUE)\n```\n\nor this:\n\n```\nadd_compile_options(-flto)\nadd_link_options(-flto)\n```",
      "parentUuid": "b42bb3df_f2fd95a9",
      "revId": "76bb869f56f69333a387704c11027145f1b887ca",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
